          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase and the Fight phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. That unit must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 if that unit is within 9&quot; of one or more ^^**Thousand Sons Psyker^^** units from your army.</characteristic>
